Native demangling dependencies

The worker-only symbol-name table in src/symbol_names.rs uses public APIs from
cpp_demangle 0.5.1 (https://github.com/gimli-rs/cpp_demangle) and rustc-demangle
0.1.28 (https://github.com/rust-lang/rustc-demangle). Both offer MIT OR Apache-2.0
licensing. These packages were already engine dependencies; the desktop's
packaged third-party notices retain their license texts. No MSVC demangler
source is copied or linked. See docs/demangling.md.
The generated deferred-backreference regression in src/symbol_names.rs adapts
the recursion_limit_backref_free_bypass test construction from rustc-demangle
0.1.28 src/v0.rs under Apache-2.0, using a smaller bounded input and rejecting
the resulting diagnostic instead of displaying it.

